  "summary": "Master hands-on implementation of Enterprise Grid with Summary & Total Footer with complete state lifecycle, edge-case resilience, and interviewer follow-ups.",
  "description": "Build a production-ready Enterprise Grid with Summary & Total Footer component in React conforming to modern best practices.\n\nKey Capabilities:\n1. Resilient state architecture using React 19 functional patterns.\n2. Smooth user interactions, event handling, and accessible controls.\n3. Production-grade error resilience, cleanup handling, and clean UX feedback.",
